}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"The Calendar Killer","overview":"Klara morirà oggi se non uccide suo marito. Il Killer del calendario le ha dato questa scelta impossibile. Durante il suo turno di notte in una linea di assistenza telefonica per donne che tornano a casa da sole, Jules riceve la chiamata di Klara. Diventerà la sua ultima speranza di sopravvivenza e lotterà contro il tempo per salvarla."},{"language":"en-US","title":"The Calendar Killer","overview":"Klara is going to die today unless she kills her husband instead. The Calendar Killer has given her that impossible choice. When Jules starts his night shift at a telephone safety helpline for lonely women on their way home, Klara's call reaches him. He soon becomes her last hope for survival and races against time to save her."},{"language":"de-DE","overview":"Der Kalender-Killer, ein berüchtigter Mörder, zwingt Klara zu einer grausamen Entscheidung: 'Er oder du!' Entweder sie tötet ihren Ehemann, oder sie selbst wird ermordet. Als Jules seine Nachtschicht bei einem telefonischen Sicherheitsdienst für einsame Frauen auf dem Heimweg beginnt, erreicht ihn Klaras Anruf. Bald wird er ihre letzte Hoffnung auf Rettung."}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mu6yOzSDxJofBvxifdJv52Y5shQ.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mu6yOzSDxJofBvxifdJv52Y5shQ.png","language":"en","width":2638,"height":558},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/l6JwCBYq2xal98y5qQ3Lr0UHEXL.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/l6JwCBYq2xal98y5qQ3Lr0UHEXL.png","language":"en","width":2638,"height":558},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/j7vY3F4TlJlglh7zt4SZYiRtcrS.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/j7vY3F4TlJlglh7zt4SZYiRtcrS.png","language":"de","width":3077,"height":485},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2IP2JTrViijK2